│                      STATE.MD (Source of Truth)                │
│                     (Shared state coordinator)                  │
│                                                                  │
│  PHASE | ANALYSIS_STATUS | INVENTORY_STATUS | DOMAIN_STATUS    │
│  BOUNDARIES_STATUS | EXTRACTION_QUEUE | SERVICES_IN_PROGRESS   │
└──────────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────┘
