## Key Principle: Event-Driven Coordination

Agents don’t wait for commands. They:

1. Watch STATE.md for changes
1. Check if prerequisites for their phase are met
1. Run autonomously when ready
1. Update STATE.md with results
1. Wake up other agents that depend on them

