## Agent Behaviors in Swarm

### Analyzer Agent (Runs once, parallel with nothing)

```
LOOP every 5 seconds:
  IF STATE.PHASE == "start" AND STATE.PHASE_0.STATUS != "complete":
    AND STATE.PHASE_0.AGENT_RUNNING == false:
    
    SET: STATE.PHASE_0.AGENT_RUNNING = true
    RUN: business-logic-analyzer skill
    UPDATE: STATE.PHASE_0.STATUS = "complete"
    SET: STATE.PHASE_0.AGENT_RUNNING = false
    
    SIGNAL: Inventory & Domain agents to wake up
```

### Inventory Agent (Runs once, parallel with nothing)

```
LOOP every 5 seconds:
  IF STATE.PHASE_1.STATUS != "complete" 
    AND STATE.PHASE_0.STATUS == "complete"
    AND STATE.PHASE_1.AGENT_RUNNING == false:
    
    SET: STATE.PHASE_1.AGENT_RUNNING = true
    RUN: migration-inventory agent
    UPDATE: STATE.PHASE_1.STATUS = "complete"
    SET: STATE.PHASE_1.AGENT_RUNNING = false
    
    SIGNAL: Domain & Boundaries agents to wake up
```

### Domain Agent (Runs once, parallel with Inventory)

```
LOOP every 5 seconds:
  IF STATE.PHASE_2.STATUS != "complete"
    AND STATE.PHASE_0.STATUS == "complete"
    AND STATE.PHASE_2.AGENT_RUNNING == false:
    
    SET: STATE.PHASE_2.AGENT_RUNNING = true
    RUN: migration-domain agent
    UPDATE: STATE.PHASE_2.STATUS = "complete"
    SET: STATE.PHASE_2.AGENT_RUNNING = false
    
    SIGNAL: Boundaries agent to wake up
```

### Boundaries Agent (Runs once, pauses at human gate)

```
LOOP every 5 seconds:
  IF STATE.PHASE_3_GATE.STATUS != "ratified"
    AND STATE.PHASE_1.STATUS == "complete"
    AND STATE.PHASE_2.STATUS == "complete":
    
    RUN: migration-boundaries agent
    DISPLAY: Boundary ratification UI
    SET: STATE.HUMAN_GATE_PENDING = true
    
    WAIT: until STATE.PHASE_3_GATE.STATUS == "ratified"
    SET: STATE.HUMAN_GATE_PENDING = false
    
    SIGNAL: Extractor agents to wake up
```

### Extractor Agent (Swarm - Multiple Concurrent Instances)

```
LOOP every 2 seconds:
  IF STATE.EXTRACTION_QUEUE exists
    AND STATE.PHASE_3_GATE.STATUS == "ratified":
    
    FIND: Next service in EXTRACTION_ORDER
      WHERE STATE.SERVICES[service].PHASE_3_STATUS == "pending"
      AND NOT already running
    
    IF service found AND parallel slots available:
      SET: STATE.SERVICES[service].PHASE_3_STATUS = "in-progress"
      SET: STATE.SERVICES[service].PHASE_3_STARTED = now()
      SET: STATE.SERVICES[service].EXTRACTOR_RUNNING = true
      
      SPAWN: migration-extractor agent for this service
      
      WAIT: for completion
      
      UPDATE: STATE.SERVICES[service].PHASE_3_STATUS = "complete"
      SET: STATE.SERVICES[service].EXTRACTOR_RUNNING = false
      
      SIGNAL: Verifier agent to wake up for this service
```

### Verifier Agent (Swarm - Multiple Concurrent Instances)

```
LOOP every 2 seconds:
  IF STATE.EXTRACTION_QUEUE exists:
    
    FIND: Service where:
      STATE.SERVICES[service].PHASE_3_STATUS == "complete"
      AND STATE.SERVICES[service].PHASE_4_STATUS != "complete"
      AND STATE.SERVICES[service].VERIFIER_RUNNING == false
    
    IF service found AND parallel slots available:
      SET: STATE.SERVICES[service].PHASE_4_STATUS = "in-progress"
      SET: STATE.SERVICES[service].PHASE_4_STARTED = now()
      SET: STATE.SERVICES[service].VERIFIER_RUNNING = true
      
      SPAWN: migration-verifier agent for this service
      
      WAIT: for completion
      
      IF VERDICT == "PASS":
        UPDATE: STATE.SERVICES[service].PHASE_4_STATUS = "complete"
        SET: STATE.SERVICES[service].VERIFIER_RUNNING = false
        SIGNAL: Hardener agent to wake up
      
      IF VERDICT == "FAIL":
        UPDATE: STATE.SERVICES[service].PHASE_4_STATUS = "failed"
        SET: STATE.SERVICES[service].VERIFIER_RUNNING = false
        FLAG: Notify user via email (manual retry needed)
```

### Hardener Agent (Swarm - Multiple Concurrent Instances)

```
LOOP every 2 seconds:
  IF STATE.EXTRACTION_QUEUE exists:
    
    FIND: Service where:
      STATE.SERVICES[service].PHASE_4_STATUS == "complete"
      AND STATE.SERVICES[service].PHASE_5_STATUS != "complete"
      AND STATE.SERVICES[service].HARDENER_RUNNING == false
    
    IF service found AND parallel slots available:
      SET: STATE.SERVICES[service].PHASE_5_STATUS = "in-progress"
      SET: STATE.SERVICES[service].PHASE_5_STARTED = now()
      SET: STATE.SERVICES[service].HARDENER_RUNNING = true
      
      SPAWN: migration-hardener agent for this service
      
      WAIT: for completion
      
      UPDATE: STATE.SERVICES[service].PHASE_5_STATUS = "complete"
      SET: STATE.SERVICES[service].HARDENER_RUNNING = false
      
      SIGNAL: User that service is ready for manual cutover
      EMAIL: "Service ${service} ready for production cutover"
      
      SET: STATE.SERVICES[service].AWAITING_MANUAL_CUTOVER = true
```

