## Concurrency Control

### Parallel Limits

```yaml
SWARM_CONFIG:
  MAX_PARALLEL_EXTRACTORS: 4
    # Run 4 extractions simultaneously
    # (Limited by monolith repo lock contention)
  
  MAX_PARALLEL_VERIFIERS: 6
    # Run 6 verifications simultaneously
    # (Limited by test environment capacity)
  
  MAX_PARALLEL_HARDENERS: 6
    # Run 6 hardening tasks simultaneously
    # (No I/O contention, CPU bound)
  
  EXTRACTION_TIMEOUT: 600 seconds (10 mins)
  VERIFICATION_TIMEOUT: 900 seconds (15 mins)
  HARDENING_TIMEOUT: 900 seconds (15 mins)
  
  RETRY_ON_TIMEOUT: 2
    # If agent exceeds timeout, retry up to 2x
```

### Dependency Chain (Per Service)

```
Service 1:  [Extract] → [Verify] → [Harden] → [Cutover]
Service 2:  [Extract] → [Verify] → [Harden] → [Cutover]
Service 3:  [Extract] → [Verify] → [Harden] → [Cutover]
...
Service 34: [Extract] → [Verify] → [Harden] → [Cutover]

Constraint: Each service must do Extract BEFORE Verify BEFORE Harden
But: Different services are completely independent
Result: Full parallelism across 34 services
```

