## Summary: Swarm vs Sequential

|Aspect               |Sequential               |Swarm                         |
|---------------------|-------------------------|------------------------------|
|**Phases 0-2**       |40 minutes               |40 minutes (parallel)         |
|**Extraction**       |1,300 hours (serial)     |40 minutes (4 parallel)       |
|**Verification**     |1,700 hours (serial)     |40 minutes (6 parallel)       |
|**Hardening**        |1,700 hours (serial)     |40 minutes (6 parallel)       |
|**Manual Cutover**   |27 hours × 34 = 918 hours|~7 days (3 env parallel)      |
|**Total Time**       |**56 days**              |**~7 days**                   |
|**Complexity**       |Low (simple routing)     |Medium (state coordination)   |
|**Failure Isolation**|1 failure = stop all     |1 failure = skip that service |
|**Infrastructure**   |1 dev laptop             |Need 3-4 parallel environments|

